Root cause:
The bug was caused by the scan-element attributes being hidden and not added to the `iio_channel`'s list of attributes, which led to failures in the extended name calculation when these attributes had extended names in their filenames. The existing code did not account for these attributes, resulting in incorrect behavior when processing channels with such attributes.

Code statements information:
The code statements that lead to the bug are:
```c
